WEBVTT

00:46:28.623 --> 00:46:31.054
CA: Susan Cain is the author of

00:46:31.078 --> 00:46:35.557
"Quiet: The Power of Introverts
in a World That Can't Stop Talking."

00:46:35.581 --> 00:46:37.972
She joined us on the TED stage in 2012,

00:46:37.996 --> 00:46:40.522
and you can listen
to that talk on ted.com.

00:46:41.126 --> 00:46:44.216
For educators or parents
who want to learn more

00:46:44.240 --> 00:46:46.615
about Susan’s approach to introversion,

00:46:46.639 --> 00:46:51.417
she recommends visiting
QuietRev.com for resources.

00:46:51.441 --> 00:46:54.194
That's "quiet R E V dot com."

00:46:54.218 --> 00:46:57.582
Susan’s currently working on a new book
that seeks to answer questions

00:46:57.606 --> 00:47:00.315
about our connections
to the sorrows of the world